Open XML SDK
------------

The validation is Microsoft's: this tool calls OpenXmlValidator from the DocumentFormat.OpenXml
package (version 3.5.1, from NuGet), which is part of the Open XML SDK. Release archives contain
that package, so the SDK's licence text is reproduced below, as its MIT licence requires.
Source: https://github.com/dotnet/Open-XML-SDK

